Alternative possible version: the first version mirrors the Authors logic (full regex + email storage in %emails) for consistency. However, since Deputies are already in %EmailField, the check already validates the Name <email> format, so we could optionally only extract the name and append it.

```diff
+		} elsif ($field eq 'Deputies') {
+			$val =~ m/^(\S[^<@>]*\S) </ or die "Malformed Deputies line in $fn";
+			my $deputyname = $1;
+			if (defined $authors) {
+				$authors .= ", $deputyname";
+			} else {
+				$authors = $deputyname;
+			}
